      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Boyer-Moore vote</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/majority-element/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 169</a></div>\r\n  <h1>Majority Element</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: pair off every two different values and throw both away; the majority has more copies than everyone else combined, so it is the one left standing. One pass, one candidate, one counter: O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\r\n"
